Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.34,0:00:06.71,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去寻找吧 收集起梦的碎片{\fad(250,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.48,0:00:17.86,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使胸中苦闷 去感受真切的现在吧{\fad(0,400)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.53,0:00:22.72,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比外表更单纯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.16,0:00:26.49,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是却无法传达
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.03,0:00:33.84,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想要说的话 总是藏在口袋里
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.31,0:00:40.61,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,充满孩子气的话语 如今已无法开口
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.61,0:00:48.58,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽说时间会冲淡一切 我们却无法相互理解
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.75,0:00:54.99,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,24小时 一直相信着你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.46,0:00:58.29,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看着你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.16,0:01:02.83,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使只是俗常的话语
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.14,0:01:09.47,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,时间总是 微笑着匆匆流逝
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.24,0:01:20.55,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比起回忆 还是去追求理想的今天{\fad(0,1025)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.30,0:01:52.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好像和父亲一起住的村子
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.51,0:01:55.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝 要走了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.28,0:01:57.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.68,0:02:09.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第55话 石之花与七宝的初恋
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.06,0:02:13.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的 该不会是假情报吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.69,0:02:17.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这种村落会有四魂碎片吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.26,0:02:22.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇也感受不到 四魂碎片的气息吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.47,0:02:23.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的 完全没有
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.30,0:02:27.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总之还是散开来寻找吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.81,0:02:29.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,解散
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.55,0:02:36.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有什么事吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.88,0:02:40.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你该不会 想一个人去勾引女人吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.42,0:02:41.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.89,0:02:45.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有妖怪的气息
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.49,0:02:48.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等 你这种态度对吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.39,0:02:50.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.43,0:02:55.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么啦 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.43,0:02:57.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明明才刚开始找耶
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.90,0:03:00.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有妖怪的话一闻就知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.81,0:03:03.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,根本就是想偷懒
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.45,0:03:08.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天气真好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.42,0:03:13.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奇怪？七宝不见了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.52,0:03:17.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大概跑去玩了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.12,0:03:20.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他还是小孩子嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.46,0:03:26.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,唉 真是让人担心
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.47,0:03:30.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这阵子一直不断战斗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.50,0:03:34.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,偶尔也该让他们两人独处一下
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.84,0:03:37.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.38,0:03:41.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,站住 臭小子
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.21,0:03:42.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,才不会被你们逮到
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.65,0:03:43.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这小偷
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.92,0:03:46.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,揍扁她
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.05,0:03:48.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,五月
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.99,0:03:51.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你偷了我们家的柿子干对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.26,0:03:53.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我才没有偷 你有看到吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.29,0:03:54.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闭嘴 你这骗子
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.46,0:03:57.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们这些家伙 等哥哥回来后
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.96,0:03:59.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会好好的修理你们一顿
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.73,0:04:00.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.47,0:04:04.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你哥哥不是早就死在战场上了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.24,0:04:07.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我父亲在他死前照顾他的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.31,0:04:09.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥哥才没有死呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.68,0:04:10.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好痛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.74,0:04:13.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,浑蛋 小偷还敢打人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.69,0:04:24.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们这些家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.26,0:04:27.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妖怪啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.19,0:04:28.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等我
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.20,0:04:40.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哼…赢了…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.94,0:04:46.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已经没事了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.21,0:04:47.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你 狸猫
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.78,0:04:48.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是狐狸啦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.15,0:04:50.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是帮助我的谢礼
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.85,0:04:52.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要不要吃一半
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.95,0:04:54.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,偷来的柿子干
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.79,0:04:56.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好吃喔
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.66,0:05:01.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来真的是这家伙不对啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.23,0:05:04.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好厉害喔
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.46,0:05:07.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我叫五月 你呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.93,0:05:10.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我 我叫做七宝
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.10,0:05:13.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝？好帅气的名字呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.11,0:05:15.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我父亲帮我取的名字
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.97,0:05:18.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来如此 你父亲是妖怪狸吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.31,0:05:19.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,狐狸啦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.68,0:05:21.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是故意的啦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.75,0:05:28.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,五月 你有亲人吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.75,0:05:31.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我出生后不久就去世了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.49,0:05:33.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来如此
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.19,0:05:35.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过我还有一个哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.76,0:05:37.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等他在战场立下大功
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.63,0:05:38.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,成为武士后
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.76,0:05:40.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就会回来迎接我
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.83,0:05:44.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那刚才那些小鬼在撒谎咯
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.57,0:05:46.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的哥哥…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.51,0:05:48.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他一定会回来
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.91,0:05:50.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算已经死了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.41,0:05:51.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他也会活着回来
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.78,0:05:56.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,特别让你看看 我的宝贝
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.78,0:05:58.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要对它许愿
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.22,0:06:00.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,任何愿望都会实现
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.16,0:06:04.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很漂亮吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.42,0:06:06.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它叫做四魂碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.42,0:06:08.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听说是妖怪的宝贝碎片喔
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.79,0:06:10.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四魂碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.94,0:06:21.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥哥 这是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.81,0:06:24.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么愿望 都能实现的四魂碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.31,0:06:28.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一定会成为武士的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.39,0:06:37.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥哥绝对不会说谎的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.40,0:06:47.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是真的吗？法师大人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.90,0:06:50.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我家有妖怪盘踞着吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.84,0:06:54.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的 若没有尽早驱除的话…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.84,0:06:56.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是法师的义务
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.34,0:06:58.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,您不需要答谢我 名主大人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.71,0:07:02.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别这么说 各位的 餐点与床铺已经准备好了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.28,0:07:05.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒那家伙又在唬人了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.09,0:07:10.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么啦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.93,0:07:14.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,地震
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.38,0:07:34.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的有妖怪啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.51,0:07:36.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的耶
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.02,0:07:38.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是胡扯啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.12,0:07:39.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.82,0:07:42.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不好了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.76,0:07:45.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.13,0:07:49.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝你居然知道这里啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.26,0:07:52.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找这附近看起来最富裕
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.46,0:07:55.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又在做法事的人家准没错
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.04,0:07:58.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总…总之
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.47,0:08:00.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我找到四魂碎片了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.91,0:08:05.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个女孩…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.14,0:08:08.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不是五月吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.42,0:08:17.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让姐姐看看你的碎片好不好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.29,0:08:18.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你该不会想抢走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.92,0:08:21.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然要抢 如果是真的的话
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.46,0:08:23.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 坐下
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.30,0:08:28.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没关系的 只是看一下
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.67,0:08:32.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了 如果是真的四魂碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.34,0:08:33.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就非拿走不可
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.91,0:08:36.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么一来五月的愿望就会…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.84,0:08:41.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我怎么会判断的这么草率
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.51,0:08:43.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,笨蛋 笨蛋 我是大笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.02,0:08:44.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.02,0:08:50.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以了吧 我要回去了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.76,0:08:52.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你 路上小心喔
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.39,0:08:55.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让她回去好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.16,0:09:00.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,五月 你还是不想来我们家吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.87,0:09:01.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不用了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.17,0:09:04.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我哥哥现正在回来的路上呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.30,0:09:07.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇 那个碎片…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.07,0:09:11.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝 那是石之花
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.88,0:09:12.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,石之花？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.94,0:09:14.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是石英吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.95,0:09:17.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总之是山上就能挖到的石头
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.82,0:09:19.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,根本不是四魂碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.59,0:09:22.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是冒牌货啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.69,0:09:26.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,五月…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.19,0:09:30.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,五月是个可怜的孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.20,0:09:32.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥哥已经确定是战死的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.06,0:09:34.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她却不愿意相信
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.60,0:09:40.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望哥哥能快点回来
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.91,0:09:44.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使我说由我们照顾她
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.21,0:09:45.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是她依然不肯离开
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.31,0:09:47.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,曾经和哥哥一起生活的小屋
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.08,0:09:54.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然被轰出了名主的家
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.85,0:09:57.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是那小女孩可以利用
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.22,0:09:58.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我记住！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.24,0:10:18.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四魂拥有能创造 奈落分身的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.44,0:10:21.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果向真正的碎片许愿的话
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.85,0:10:25.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,五月的哥哥就能活着回来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.78,0:10:58.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,图形好可怕…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.08,0:11:00.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉了 戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.42,0:11:07.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.89,0:11:11.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉！你不是在睡觉吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.30,0:11:12.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放过我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.70,0:11:14.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这也是帮助人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.67,0:11:16.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别做梦了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.80,0:11:21.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝 你也知道四魂之玉的可怕吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.31,0:11:23.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那不是人类能使用的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.18,0:11:28.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,话说回来 你为什么要偏袒那小女孩啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.68,0:11:30.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迷恋人家了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.92,0:11:33.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她的脸长得蛮可爱的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.69,0:11:36.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这家伙 为了这么烂的理由
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.52,0:11:37.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,少罗唆
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.96,0:11:39.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算我迷恋她
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.92,0:11:44.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在桔梗跟戈薇之间 摇摆不定的你也没资格说我
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.50,0:11:47.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去睡觉啦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.54,0:11:53.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.62,0:12:08.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,五月
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.05,0:12:10.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.56,0:12:18.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥哥…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.43,0:12:23.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让你久等了 你过得好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.57,0:12:25.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.57,0:12:29.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一直相信！我一直相信着！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.47,0:12:32.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥哥一定会回来的…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.08,0:12:41.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,至少应该向她道别
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.12,0:12:45.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,五月会不会一直 对着假碎片祈祷呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.66,0:12:48.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是我实在说不出口
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.96,0:12:50.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,事情的真相…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.30,0:12:52.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.10,0:12:54.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,五月
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.40,0:12:56.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的愿望实现了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.50,0:12:58.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥哥回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.61,0:13:07.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 七宝呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.61,0:13:10.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在那叫做五月的女孩那边吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.92,0:13:13.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他真的很担心她呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.42,0:13:17.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,五月的哥哥早就不在人世了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.12,0:13:21.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她却深信假的碎片而等待着
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.83,0:13:24.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去一下
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.13,0:13:26.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你又要多管闲事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.30,0:13:28.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等 戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.63,0:13:30.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也一起去
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.01,0:13:35.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看 虽然哥哥受了一点伤
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.94,0:13:38.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥哥真的回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.14,0:13:39.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,五月
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.34,0:13:43.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都是托你和四魂碎片的福
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.59,0:13:54.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么！妖怪？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.96,0:13:59.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥哥要快点治好伤口 恢复精神喔
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.83,0:14:03.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊…让你吃了这么多苦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.57,0:14:06.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以后哥哥会让你很幸福的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.54,0:14:08.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,五月
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.94,0:14:10.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你过来一下
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.11,0:14:13.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哎呀…你是…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.35,0:14:18.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在名主家借宿的 那一行人的伙伴吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.38,0:14:20.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,五月 快点
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.55,0:14:22.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.22,0:14:24.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你能把那东西拿来吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.49,0:14:26.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真正的四魂碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.13,0:14:28.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放开五月
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.86,0:14:32.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要做什么 哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.50,0:14:34.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四魂碎片的话
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.37,0:14:36.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里不就有一个吗 你看
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.20,0:14:39.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还不明白啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.80,0:14:43.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这种烂石头一点用都没有
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.14,0:14:48.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,居然将实现五月愿望的碎片…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.62,0:14:51.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点 矮子
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.12,0:14:53.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去拿四魂碎片来
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.39,0:14:57.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不然我就扭断五月的脖子
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.22,0:15:00.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你…你是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.43,0:15:05.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然是你哥哥啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.23,0:15:06.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现出原形吧 妖怪！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.13,0:15:09.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,狐火！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.40,0:15:14.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这小鬼真狠
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.64,0:15:18.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我本来觉得当她哥哥也不错
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.24,0:15:20.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,五月
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.24,0:15:23.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,浑蛋 我饶不了你
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.42,0:15:30.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,五月 快点
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.20,0:15:45.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,臭小鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.84,0:15:53.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已经被发现了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.34,0:15:55.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,休想逃走
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.38,0:15:56.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就用这个
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.71,0:15:59.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,五月 你先逃走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.35,0:16:02.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要 我怎么能这样做
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.15,0:16:05.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这只能一个人骑啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.59,0:16:07.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.56,0:16:12.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,逮到你了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.24,0:16:25.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是五月住的小木屋吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.45,0:16:31.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,仔细看 是大肚子妖怪的杰作
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.09,0:16:34.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,至少他们似乎是逃走了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.79,0:16:35.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧 弥勒
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.09,0:16:37.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总之先追上七宝
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.96,0:16:41.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们两人一定要平安啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.17,0:16:48.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是七宝的狐妖术
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.47,0:16:49.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是五月
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.48,0:16:59.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,了不起 云母
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.88,0:17:01.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝在妖怪那里
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.82,0:17:04.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道了 走吧 戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.62,0:17:10.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,五月 你一定要平安逃走
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.90,0:17:21.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小女孩逃走是没用的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.07,0:17:24.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,反正都一样
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.21,0:17:26.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,矮子 我要拿你当人质
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.21,0:17:28.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去抢四魂碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.94,0:17:31.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你一开始就应该找我
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.21,0:17:34.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,居然还刻意践踏五月的心
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.92,0:17:36.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,浑蛋 我饶不了你
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.15,0:17:40.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有意思 你想和我打吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.69,0:17:42.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那当然
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.36,0:17:44.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接招 消化液
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.50,0:17:49.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,分身
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.80,0:17:52.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接招 爆雷筒…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.50,0:17:54.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,趁现在
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.47,0:18:03.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,臭小子 你闹够了没有
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.95,0:18:10.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的力量还是不够吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.62,0:18:19.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不能跟大家一样战斗吗…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.50,0:18:25.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,游戏结束了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.47,0:18:35.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么 还没得到教训
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.78,0:18:39.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又变成奇怪的家伙…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.98,0:18:42.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,臭家伙 你在找碴吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.72,0:18:49.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚刚好…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.26,0:18:51.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拿你试试刚领悟的爆流破
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.06,0:18:56.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,臭小子 你在胡说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.97,0:19:03.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,将对手的妖气卷入风之伤中
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.54,0:19:05.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再让妖气逆流的必杀剑
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.01,0:19:14.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爆流…啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.55,0:19:17.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶！对手的妖气太弱了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.55,0:19:19.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爆流破根本就用不出来嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.55,0:19:21.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在罗哩叭唆什么
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.82,0:19:23.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说你这家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.56,0:19:25.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太弱了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.69,0:19:27.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是真的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.83,0:19:38.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是昨晚从名主家中 赶走的妖怪吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.34,0:19:43.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.58,0:19:48.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝 你这次相当努力嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.82,0:19:51.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.35,0:19:52.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.85,0:19:53.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.09,0:19:55.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.32,0:19:58.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你解决了那只妖怪对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.56,0:20:02.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是我 是犬夜叉…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.30,0:20:03.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我来的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.07,0:20:06.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妖怪就已经被扁得很惨了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.10,0:20:09.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.54,0:20:12.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这只妖怪知道打不过我们
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.77,0:20:14.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以想利用五月吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.58,0:20:17.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一牵扯到四魂碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.38,0:20:19.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家都会遭遇不幸
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.35,0:20:22.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都怪我忘的一干二净
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.38,0:20:24.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,才让五月碰到这种事
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.39,0:20:30.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,五月 对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.06,0:20:37.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有关系的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.40,0:20:42.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,五月
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.67,0:20:44.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我决定了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.61,0:20:46.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要让名主大人照顾
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.87,0:20:48.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实我已经知道
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.64,0:20:50.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥哥已经不在人世了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.79,0:21:00.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,保重喔 五月
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.62,0:21:05.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你 七宝
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.16,0:21:07.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能遇见你真的太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.50,0:21:13.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,五月 你一定要幸福
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.93,0:21:16.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我和你一样没有父母
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.31,0:21:22.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是 我不是一个人活着
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.02,0:21:39.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝 你是不是喜欢那孩子啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.39,0:21:40.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,果然没错
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.96,0:21:43.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是人小鬼大
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.46,0:21:46.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然小也是男人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.13,0:21:49.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,初恋呀…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.47,0:21:52.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝 走了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.74,0:21:56.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝 再拖拖拉拉就不理你喔
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.34,0:21:58.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.23,0:22:29.44,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,何不把真正重要的事物以外{\fad(500,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.54,0:22:41.35,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全部 都舍弃呢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.82,0:22:49.02,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现实 往往是如此残酷
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.30,0:22:52.03,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但每当 遇到这种时刻
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.27,0:22:56.29,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只要紧闭双眼
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.84,0:23:04.04,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,便能看见 你的笑容{\fad(0,900)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.55,0:23:11.01,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Ah- 但愿从此以往
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.59,0:23:19.05,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,直到进入 沉眠的那一刻
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.79,0:23:26.39,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的 那抹笑容
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.80,0:23:34.77,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都绝没有 消逝的瞬间{\fad(0,900)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.22,0:23:47.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有个村子里的男人
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.76,0:23:51.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全都被妖怪公主魅惑 而一去不回
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.83,0:23:53.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然弥勒法师 单枪匹马前去驱逐
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.13,0:23:55.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是提到弥勒法师的弱点
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.13,0:23:57.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是美丽的女人
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.00,0:23:59.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这下子就有点危险了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.00,0:24:01.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然担心他的珊瑚
